  return `
To import from LighterPack:

Option 1 - CSV Export (Recommended):
1. Go to your LighterPack list
2. Click "Export" > "CSV"
3. Upload the CSV file using the file upload option

Option 2 - Manual Copy (Advanced):
1. Go to your LighterPack list
2. Right-click > "View Source" or press Ctrl+U
3. Copy all the HTML content
4. Paste it in the text area below

We'll automatically parse your gear data from either format.
`.trim()
}

